 ЁЁ We know i82 was released a little while ago but we still figured we      ЁЁ
 ЁЁ should share this updated little hack  with you. It features a very nice ЁЁ
 ЁЁ trainerengine that lets you patch the .EXE (of course you can unpatch it ЁЁ
 ЁЁ back when you dont want to cheat anymore).                               ЁЁ
 ЁЁ It should be very fast and easy to use since you dont have to keep it    ЁЁ
 ЁЁ memory active when playing the game.                                     ЁЁ
 ЁЁ So to all of you who requested this: Enjoy!                              ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ  Ч To use this hack, run it inside the main directory-- install it and   ЁЁ
 ЁЁ     then go blow some people up in trip mode!                            ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ   [1]: Gives you a lot of armor                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ   [2]: Way bigger tires                                                  ЁЁ
 ЁЁ   [3]: 2 Heavy Machine Guns on the front                                 ЁЁ
 ЁЁ   [4]: 2 Cannon Turrets on the roof and a couple specials                ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                    unixfu- / RAZOR 1911  ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                            Install and Rip Notes                         ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                            ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~                         ЁЁ
 ЁЁ                                                                          ЁЁ
 ЁЁ Unzip it to the i82 main directory where i82stub.exe is held, make sure  ЁЁ
 ЁЁ the game is not running!  Then run the program and install. If you wish  ЁЁ
 ЁЁ to play online multiplayer, I suggest you remove this hack before play   ЁЁ
 ЁЁ ing because if you don't, if you use the Royal and join a game-- it will ЁЁ
 ЁЁ boot you out of the game.  If you host a game and someone trys to join   ЁЁ
 ЁЁ with a Royal, it will boot them out of you game.  So don't forget to     ЁЁ
 ЁЁ remove this hack before playing online!                                  ЁЁ
